# Invitation media

Export final assets from Canva into this folder and wire the paths in `src/config/wedding.ts` under `assets`.

Recommended filenames:

```text
cover-forest.jpg      # cover gate background
hero.jpg              # couple hero photo
venue-forest.jpg      # venue section background
couple.jpg            # mid-page couple photo
gallery-1.jpg
gallery-2.jpg
footer-forest.jpg     # footer background
```

Example config:

```ts
assets: {
  coverBackground: "/invitation/cover-forest.jpg",
  heroPhoto: "/invitation/hero.jpg",
  venueBackground: "/invitation/venue-forest.jpg",
  couplePhoto: "/invitation/couple.jpg",
  gallery: ["/invitation/gallery-1.jpg", "/invitation/gallery-2.jpg"],
  footerBackground: "/invitation/footer-forest.jpg",
},
```

Until files exist, the UI shows intentional CSS placeholders.
